{"id":"786bb0f333d3a09f","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-filter2-normal-filter.md","title":"ZFC Filter2 Normal Filter","display":"df-zfc-filter2-normal-filter — ZFC Filter2 Normal Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter2-normal-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter2-normal-filter","58-df-zfc-filter6-normal-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter2-normal-filter — ZFC Filter2 Normal Filter","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter2-normal-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter2-normal-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-filter6-normal-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter2-normal-filter — ZFC Filter2 Normal Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span> (regular uncountable cardinal)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span> (candidate filter)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)\\)</span> (cofinality of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\kappa)\\)</span> (set-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NormalFilter}\">\\(\\operatorname{NormalFilter}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 上使用，取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a> 所定的唯一共尾度；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span> 为类缩写，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}normal\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\operatorname{NormalFilter}(\\mathcal F,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\kappa)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F^\\kappa\\;\\left(\\{\\xi\\in\\kappa:\\forall\\eta\\in\\xi\\;(\\xi\\in A(\\eta))\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}normal\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\operatorname{NormalFilter}(\\mathcal F,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\kappa)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F^\\kappa\\;\\left(\\{\\xi\\in\\kappa:\\forall\\eta\\in\\xi\\;(\\xi\\in A(\\eta))\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Normality is closure under diagonal intersections of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-sequences from the filter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\kappa)$ (set-filter predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)$ 仅在 $\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$ 上使用，取 [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]] 所定的唯一共尾度；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 见 [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)$ 仅在 $\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$ 上使用，取 [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]] 所定的唯一共尾度；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 见 [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 $\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$，$\\mathrm{Card}$ 为类缩写，见 [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 $\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$，$\\mathrm{Card}$ 为类缩写，见 [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NormalFilter}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Card}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}normal\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\operatorname